===Verb===
{{non-verb|dó|dó|dáinn}}

# to [[die]]
#* verse 76 of the ''{{w|Hávamál}}'' (1996 translation by Carolyne Larrington)
#*: {{quote|non|'''Deyr''' fé, / '''deyja''' frændr, / '''deyr''' sjalfr it sama, / en orðstírr / '''deyr''' aldregi, / hveim er sér góðan getr.|Cattle '''die''', / kinsmen '''die''' / the self '''dies''' the same; / but word-glory never '''dies''', / for the one who gets himself a good one.}}

